<code>assert \result == \old(this.numberOfSets()) + 1;</code>

However, since the method `addElement` does not return a value (`void`), we cannot use `\result`. Instead, we need to use the post-state of `numberOfSets()` directly:

<code>assert this.numberOfSets() == \old(this.numberOfSets()) + 1;</code>
--------------------
<code>assert \old(this.numberOfSets()) + 1 == this.numberOfSets();</code>
--------------------
